{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の父の日企画の\n純奈、なんかこわかったね...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です(・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンダと見つめ合う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、\n深川さん卒業おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「じゅんなのJしよ〜〜」って\n深川さんが言って出来たＪ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡のライブでは始まる前から\nちょっと泣いちゃったりしたけど\n笑顔で見送りたかったから、\n必死に我慢してたけどやっぱり\nダメでした(´･_･`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がる蕾を歌ってる深川さんをみて\n「あーほんとに卒業しちゃうんだ」\nって思ったら涙が止まらなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wアンコールをして頂いて歌った\nハルジオンは本当に楽しかったけど\nめっちゃ涙出てきてヽ(；▽；)ノ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこにいるだけでその場の雰囲気を\n和ませてくれる、癒しをくれる。\n会うだけで幸せな気持ちになれる。\n一緒にお仕事する機会は選抜よりも\n全然少なかったけど会えた時はいつも\n癒されてました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\n深川さんの活動を応援します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年間本当にお疲れ様でした。\nだいだいだいすき！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム個別in京都\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽ノックのMV衣装！\nすごい好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の土曜日は\n幕張メッセでアルバム個別！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の衣装がいいと思いますかっ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/22/8822080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎OVERTURE 発売中\n◎月刊エンタメ 30日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてください〜〜♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事がんばるぞー！\nみんなも頑張ってね（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}